ce capping","Financial Intelligence — Dual-currency (INR/USD) display of 10 listed Adani Group companies with market cap, debt-to-equity heatmap, P/E ratios, and sortable tables","Lobbying & Political Tracker — Global lobbying spend across 5 countries, electoral bond donation tracker, law firm engagement mapping","Intelligence Feed — Filterable news feed with source tier badges, validation score bars, bias detection warnings, and keyword search"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cockroachparty/cockroachjanathaparty-agspe/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e06871615eae437e1b213a2c075b8355878249321077e671f93dad52061c1930","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:12.707Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:12.707Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An open-source automated intelligence platform 😝 developed under the broader research and transparency ethos associated with the Cockroach Janta Party movement — focused on ingesting public data about the Adani Group ecosystem, validating information through a multi-tier cross-source protocol, and generating probabilistic predictions on future business moves with confidence scores and timelines.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cockroachparty/cockroachjanathaparty-agspe/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"Zero-Config Deployment — Deploy to Vercel in one click; works immediately with built-in mock data as fallback — no API keys required","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cockroachparty/cockroachjanathaparty-agspe/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e06871615eae437e1b213a2c075b8355878249321077e671f93dad52061c1930","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cockroachparty/cockroachjanathaparty-agspe/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:12.708Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T21:04:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cockroachparty/cockroachjanathaparty-agspe/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"202